 =?UTF-8?q?=D0=B2?= <iadmin@aviales.local>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 16:51:23 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 11/14] Android: Add WebContent process thread + SurfaceView
 integration
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- UI/Android/app/src/main/cpp/WebContentProcess.{h,cpp}: Dedicated thread for LibWeb/LibJS rendering with IPC message loop
  - Unix pipe IPC for UI ↔ WebContent communication (LoadURL, Resize, MouseEvent, ScrollEvent, PaintRequest messages)
  - Main event loop polls IPC and processes WebContent tasks (HTML parsing, layout, paint)
  - Stubs for LibWeb::Page, JS::VM, and LibCore::EventLoop (to be linked after vcpkg manifest)
- AndroidViewImplementation: Spawn WebContentProcess on initialization, forward load_url/input events via IPC
  - request_repaint() clears ANativeWindow to white (placeholder for Skia/ANGLE compositor)
- LadybirdWebView.kt: Compose AndroidView wrapper for SurfaceView
  - Creates native WebView handle when Surface is ready, destroys on dispose
  - Calls nativeLoadURL when URL changes
- MainActivity.kt: Show LadybirdWebView when navigating, welcome screen when idle, diagnostics screen on INFO button
  - Address bar auto-prepends https:// if no scheme
  - INFO button toggles between browser and diagnostics

Bootstrap APK builds and runs. WebContentProcess thread spawns, IPC pipe created, Surface clears to white on navigation. Next: Link LibWeb/LibJS after vcpkg manifest completes.
